#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:2
msgid "Logging Overview"
msgstr "Vue d'ensemble de la journalisation"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:4
msgid ""
"|morpheus| provides a comprehensive logging system that captures, "
"aggregates, and forwards logs from the appliance, managed hosts, and "
"virtual machines."
msgstr "|morpheus| fournit un système de journalisation complet qui capture, agrège et transfère les journaux de l'appliance, des hôtes gérés et des machines virtuelles."

